      "explanation": "\\(\\sqrt{1/2}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\) and \\(\\sqrt{8}=2\\sqrt{2}\\). Their sum is \\((\\frac{1}{2}+2)\\sqrt{2}=\\frac{5}{2}\\sqrt{2}\\), so \\(k=\\frac{5}{2}\\).",
